   'Why is it important to consider indigenous plant species in range management planning?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"They are always the most nutritious option for livestock."},{"id":"b","text":"They are rare and should not be grazed."},{"id":"c","text":"They require less water compared to all exotic species."},{"id":"d","text":"They are well-adapted to local conditions and support ecosystem stability."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
