   'What is the main objective of a range inventory?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"To determine the optimal time for livestock sale"},{"id":"b","text":"To establish the genetic diversity of livestock"},{"id":"c","text":"To measure soil pH variations"},{"id":"d","text":"To monitor and evaluate vegetation cover and composition"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fp-g00172', 'forest-production', 'range-management', 'Medium', 'practice',
   'Which of the following grazing methods is best suited for maintaining soil health on Philippine rangelands?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Continuous grazing"},{"id":"b","text":"Rotational grazing"},{"id":"c","text":"Deferred grazing"},{"id":"d","text":"Alternate grazing"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fp-g00173', 'forest-production', 'range-management', 'Medium', 'practice',
   'What is the primary consideration when determining the appropriate stocking density for a rangeland area?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Animal breed"},{"id":"b","text":"Climate conditions"},{"id":"c","text":"Water supply"},{"id":"d","text":"Forage availability"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fp-g00174', 'forest-production', 'range-management', 'Medium', 'practice',
   'Which of the following is an effective technique to increase forage production in a degraded rangeland?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Overgrazing"},{"id":"b","text":"Fertilization"},{"id":"c","text":"Selective logging"},{"id":"d","text":"Clear-cutting"}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fp-g00175', 'forest-production', 'range-management', 'Medium', 'practice',
   'In the context of range management, what is the main function of using paddocks?',
