   'Under multiple uses forestry, which of the following is a key consideration in forest management planning?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Exclusive focus on industrial wood production"},{"id":"b","text":"Maximizing immediate financial returns"},{"id":"c","text":"Balancing environmental, social, and economic values"},{"id":"d","text":"Eliminating all non-commercial plant species"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
