   'What does the term ''sustainable yield'' mean in the context of multiple uses forestry?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Harvesting resources at a rate that exceeds natural regeneration"},{"id":"b","text":"Extracting as many resources as possible in the short term"},{"id":"c","text":"Focusing solely on timber production"},{"id":"d","text":"Maintaining harvest levels that do not compromise future forest productivity"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
