   'Which of the following is a benefit of implementing multiple uses forestry?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Enhanced ecosystem services"},{"id":"b","text":"Increased deforestation rates"},{"id":"c","text":"Reduced biodiversity"},{"id":"d","text":"Decreased local community involvement"}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
