   'Which government agency in the Philippines is primarily responsible for managing forest resources under the multiple uses forestry approach?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Department of Agriculture (DA)"},{"id":"b","text":"Department of Tourism (DOT)"},{"id":"c","text":"Department of Environment and Natural Resources (DENR)"},{"id":"d","text":"Department of Public Works and Highways (DPWH)"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
