   'What is the main purpose of CBFMA in the context of multiple uses forestry in the Philippines?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"To grant forest management rights to local communities"},{"id":"b","text":"To regulate timber imports and exports"},{"id":"c","text":"To establish national parks"},{"id":"d","text":"To manage wildlife sanctuaries"}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fp-g00209', 'forest-production', 'multiple-use-forestry', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'In multiple uses forestry, which timber species is commonly managed in the Philippines for its economic value?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Narra / Pterocarpus indicus / Fabaceae"},{"id":"b","text":"Black Spruce / Picea mariana / Pinaceae"},{"id":"c","text":"Balsa / Ochroma pyramidale / Malvaceae"},{"id":"d","text":"Douglas Fir / Pseudotsuga menziesii / Pinaceae"}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fp-g00210', 'forest-production', 'multiple-use-forestry', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'Which term describes the balanced management of forests for wood production, wildlife habitat, and recreation?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Monoculture forestry"},{"id":"b","text":"Agroforestry"},{"id":"c","text":"Multiple uses forestry"},{"id":"d","text":"Silviculture"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fp-g00211', 'forest-production', 'multiple-use-forestry', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'What is the primary goal of multiple uses forestry when considering ecological and economic aspects?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Profit maximization"},{"id":"b","text":"Clear-cutting"},{"id":"c","text":"Sustainability"},{"id":"d","text":"Deforestation"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fp-g00212', 'forest-production', 'multiple-use-forestry', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'Which Philippine law focuses on wildlife resources conservation, aligning with multiple uses forestry principles?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"RA 11038"},{"id":"b","text":"RA 7586"},{"id":"c","text":"RA 9147"},{"id":"d","text":"PD 705"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fp-g00213', 'forest-production', 'multiple-use-forestry', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'In the context of multiple uses forestry, what is an example of a forest service?',
